  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) - UK Centre for Ecology and Hydrology</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UKRI COVID-19 Grant Extension Allocation (CoA) provided organisations with resources to sustain UKRI grant-funded research during the period of pandemic disruption and its immediate aftermath. Some of the funding was directly used supporting the following ODA-eligible grants at UK Centre for Ecology and Hydrology: NE/S006087/2; 
BB/R022852/1; 
MR/P024335/2.</narrative>
  </description>
